{"seq":3,"slug":"large-table-migrations","title":"大表迁移实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/operations/large-table-migrations","wordCount":1156,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"大表迁移实战\">大表迁移实战</h1><p>当表的行数超过十亿、数据量达到数百 GB 时，即使使用 gh-ost 或 pt-osc 这样的在线变更工具，迁移仍然充满挑战：chunk copy 可能需要数天、binlog 消费可能跟不上写入速度、磁盘空间可能不足、replica lag 可能持续触发限流。大表迁移不是简单地运行工具命令，而是一个需要精密规划、持续监控、动态调整的运维工程项目。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>大表迁移的核心挑战可以归纳为四个维度：时间、空间、带宽、风险。它们互相制约，优化一个维度通常意味着在另一个维度付出代价。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 四维制约&#10;        A[时间 - 多久能完成?] --- B[空间 - 需要多少磁盘?]&#10;        B --- C[带宽 - 对线上流量影响?]&#10;        C --- D[风险 - 出错的后果?]&#10;        D --- A&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    E[加大 chunk_size] --&gt;|缩短时间| A&#10;    E --&gt;|增加单次 IO| C&#10;    F[并行拷贝] --&gt;|缩短时间| A&#10;    F --&gt;|增加 replica lag| C&#10;    G[限流/暂停] --&gt;|降低影响| C&#10;    G --&gt;|延长时间| A&#10;    H[保留旧表] --&gt;|降低风险| D&#10;    H --&gt;|2x 空间| B\">graph TD\n    subgraph 四维制约\n        A[时间 - 多久能完成?] --- B[空间 - 需要多少磁盘?]\n        B --- C[带宽 - 对线上流量影响?]\n        C --- D[风险 - 出错的后果?]\n        D --- A\n    end\n\n    E[加大 chunk_size] --&gt;|缩短时间| A\n    E --&gt;|增加单次 IO| C\n    F[并行拷贝] --&gt;|缩短时间| A\n    F --&gt;|增加 replica lag| C\n    G[限流/暂停] --&gt;|降低影响| C\n    G --&gt;|延长时间| A\n    H[保留旧表] --&gt;|降低风险| D\n    H --&gt;|2x 空间| B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表规模</th>\n<th>预估 chunk copy 时间</th>\n<th>磁盘空间需求</th>\n<th>主要瓶颈</th>\n<th>建议策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1-10 GB</td>\n<td>10分钟 ~ 1小时</td>\n<td>2x 表大小</td>\n<td>IO 带宽</td>\n<td>直接跑，低峰执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10-100 GB</td>\n<td>1 ~ 12 小时</td>\n<td>2x + 50GB binlog</td>\n<td>IO + replica lag</td>\n<td>限流 + 监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 GB - 1 TB</td>\n<td>12 ~ 72 小时</td>\n<td>2x + 200GB binlog</td>\n<td>全方位</td>\n<td>专项规划 + 逐步限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 1 TB</td>\n<td>数天 ~ 数周</td>\n<td>3x+ (含备份缓冲)</td>\n<td>时间窗口</td>\n<td>分片/分阶段策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"执行前规划清单\">执行前规划清单</h2><p>开始大表迁移前，必须完成以下评估：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 数据量与写入特征</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- MySQL: 表大小和行数&#10;SELECT table_name,&#10;       ROUND(data_length / 1024 / 1024 / 1024, 2) AS data_gb,&#10;       ROUND(index_length / 1024 / 1024 / 1024, 2) AS index_gb,&#10;       table_rows&#10;FROM information_schema.tables&#10;WHERE table_schema = &#39;myapp&#39; AND table_name = &#39;orders&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 写入 QPS 评估（过去 1 小时）&#10;SELECT ROUND(&#10;  (SELECT VARIABLE_VALUE FROM performance_schema.global_status&#10;   WHERE VARIABLE_NAME = &#39;Innodb_rows_inserted&#39;) / 3600&#10;) AS inserts_per_sec;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL: 表大小和行数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> table_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_length </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_gb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(index_length </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index_gb,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       table_rows</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> information_schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tables</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> table_schema </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'myapp'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> table_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 写入 QPS 评估（过去 1 小时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VARIABLE_VALUE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> performance_schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">global_status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VARIABLE_NAME </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Innodb_rows_inserted'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inserts_per_sec;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>2. 磁盘空间预留</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 最小预留 = 表大小 × 2.5（影子表 + binlog 积累 + 安全余量）&#10;# 500GB 表 → 至少预留 1.25TB 可用空间&#10;df -h /var/lib/mysql\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最小预留 = 表大小 × 2.5（影子表 + binlog 积累 + 安全余量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 500GB 表 → 至少预留 1.25TB 可用空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">df</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/lib/mysql</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>3. 网络与复制拓扑</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 复制延迟基线&#10;SHOW SLAVE STATUS\\G&#10;-- Seconds_Behind_Master: 0 (健康基线)&#10;-- 如果平时就有 &gt; 0 的基线 lag，迁移会更容易触发限流\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 复制延迟基线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW SLAVE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\\G</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Seconds_Behind_Master: 0 (健康基线)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如果平时就有 > 0 的基线 lag，迁移会更容易触发限流</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>4. 时间窗口选择</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"周一~周四: 写入高峰, QPS 5000+  ← 不适合开始&#10;周五晚 ~ 周一早: 低谷, QPS 500  ← 最佳启动时机&#10;节假日: 最低谷                   ← 大表首选\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>周一~周四: 写入高峰, QPS 5000+  ← 不适合开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>周五晚 ~ 周一早: 低谷, QPS 500  ← 最佳启动时机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>节假日: 最低谷                   ← 大表首选</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"chunk-策略与自适应调速\">Chunk 策略与自适应调速</h2><p><strong>chunk_size 的动态调整</strong>：</p>\n<p>gh-ost 内建自适应 chunk_size 算法：目标是让每个 chunk 的执行时间在 100ms~1s 之间。如果某个 chunk 耗时超长（遇到热点区域），自动缩小；如果持续很快，逐步放大。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gh-ost \\&#10;  --chunk-size=1000 \\         # 起始 chunk 大小&#10;  --dml-batch-size=10 \\       # binlog 回放批次&#10;  --nice-ratio=0.5 \\          # chunk 间休眠：执行 100ms 则休眠 50ms&#10;  --max-lag-millis=1500 \\     # replica lag 阈值&#10;  --throttle-additional-flag-file=/tmp/gh-ost-throttle \\  # 手动限流开关&#10;  --execute\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh-ost</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --chunk-size=1000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 起始 chunk 大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --dml-batch-size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # binlog 回放批次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --nice-ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # chunk 间休眠：执行 100ms 则休眠 50ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --max-lag-millis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1500</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # replica lag 阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  --throttle-additional-flag-file</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/tmp/gh-ost-throttle</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 手动限流开关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  --execute</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>nice-ratio 的权衡</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>nice-ratio=0</code>（无休眠）：最快完成，但 IO 和 CPU 占用最高</li>\n<li><code>nice-ratio=1</code>（等时休眠）：执行 100ms → 休眠 100ms，速度减半但影响小</li>\n<li><code>nice-ratio=2+</code>：极度保守，适用于 IO 能力有限的系统</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>分区表的 chunk 策略</strong>：</p>\n<p>对于分区表，chunk copy 可以按分区并行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# pt-osc 对分区表的处理&#10;pt-online-schema-change \\&#10;  D=myapp,t=orders \\&#10;  --alter=&quot;ADD COLUMN note TEXT&quot; \\&#10;  --chunk-size=5000 \\&#10;  --chunk-time=0.5 \\    # 每 chunk 目标耗时 0.5s&#10;  --execute&#10;# pt-osc 会自动识别分区边界，按分区顺序拷贝\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pt-osc 对分区表的处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pt-online-schema-change</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  D=myapp,t=orders</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --alter=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ADD COLUMN note TEXT\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --chunk-size=5000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --chunk-time=0.5</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 每 chunk 目标耗时 0.5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  --execute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pt-osc 会自动识别分区边界，按分区顺序拷贝</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"replica-lag-管理\">Replica Lag 管理</h2><p>大表迁移期间，replica lag 是最需要关注的指标。每个 chunk copy 写入 master → 通过 binlog 复制到 replica。如果 copy 速度超过 replica 的 apply 速度，lag 就会增长。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Master&#10;    participant gh-ost as gh-ost 进程&#10;    participant Replica&#10;&#10;    gh-ost-&gt;&gt;Master: chunk copy (INSERT ... SELECT)&#10;    Master-&gt;&gt;Replica: binlog event&#10;    Note over Replica: apply event (可能慢于产生速度)&#10;&#10;    gh-ost-&gt;&gt;Replica: 查询 lag&#10;    Replica--&gt;&gt;gh-ost: lag = 2.5s&#10;    Note over gh-ost: lag &gt; max_lag(1.5s), 暂停!&#10;&#10;    Note over Replica: 追赶中...&#10;    gh-ost-&gt;&gt;Replica: 查询 lag&#10;    Replica--&gt;&gt;gh-ost: lag = 0.8s&#10;    Note over gh-ost: lag &lt; max_lag, 恢复!\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Master\n    participant gh-ost as gh-ost 进程\n    participant Replica\n\n    gh-ost-&gt;&gt;Master: chunk copy (INSERT ... SELECT)\n    Master-&gt;&gt;Replica: binlog event\n    Note over Replica: apply event (可能慢于产生速度)\n\n    gh-ost-&gt;&gt;Replica: 查询 lag\n    Replica--&gt;&gt;gh-ost: lag = 2.5s\n    Note over gh-ost: lag &gt; max_lag(1.5s), 暂停!\n\n    Note over Replica: 追赶中...\n    gh-ost-&gt;&gt;Replica: 查询 lag\n    Replica--&gt;&gt;gh-ost: lag = 0.8s\n    Note over gh-ost: lag &lt; max_lag, 恢复!</pre><p><strong>多 replica 环境的策略</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 监控多个 replica，取最大 lag&#10;gh-ost \\&#10;  --throttle-control-replicas=&quot;replica1:3306,replica2:3306,replica3:3306&quot; \\&#10;  --max-lag-millis=1500\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 监控多个 replica，取最大 lag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh-ost</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --throttle-control-replicas=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"replica1:3306,replica2:3306,replica3:3306\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --max-lag-millis=1500</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>与读写分离的交互</strong>：如果应用从 replica 读数据，lag 意味着读到的是过时数据。对于强一致性要求的读取（如支付状态查询），迁移期间需要将这些读请求临时路由到 master。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cut-over-时机与执行\">Cut-over 时机与执行</h2><p>大表迁移中，cut-over 是唯一需要短暂阻塞的时刻。对于大表，cut-over 的风险更高：</p>\n<p><strong>cut-over 前确认</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>binlog 消费 lag &lt; 100ms（接近追平）</li>\n<li>无长事务持有目标表的 MDL</li>\n<li>replica lag 在健康范围内</li>\n<li>当前时间不在流量高峰</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# gh-ost: 手动控制 cut-over 时机&#10;gh-ost \\&#10;  --postpone-cut-over-flag-file=/tmp/gh-ost-postpone \\&#10;  --execute&#10;&#10;# 准备好后，删除 postpone flag 文件触发 cut-over&#10;rm /tmp/gh-ost-postpone&#10;# gh-ost 会在下一个检查周期执行 cut-over\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># gh-ost: 手动控制 cut-over 时机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh-ost</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --postpone-cut-over-flag-file=/tmp/gh-ost-postpone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --execute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 准备好后，删除 postpone flag 文件触发 cut-over</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/gh-ost-postpone</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># gh-ost 会在下一个检查周期执行 cut-over</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>cut-over 失败处理</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 如果 cut-over 因锁超时失败：&#10;# gh-ost 会自动重试（--cut-over-lock-timeout-seconds=3）&#10;# 重试次数用尽后报告失败，但影子表保留&#10;# 人工介入：kill 长事务后重新触发 cut-over\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果 cut-over 因锁超时失败：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># gh-ost 会自动重试（--cut-over-lock-timeout-seconds=3）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重试次数用尽后报告失败，但影子表保留</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 人工介入：kill 长事务后重新触发 cut-over</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"超大表的分阶段策略\">超大表的分阶段策略</h2><p>当表超过 1TB 或 chunk copy 预估超过一周时，需要更复杂的策略：</p>\n<p><strong>策略一：分片分批迁移</strong></p>\n<p>如果表按时间分区或有逻辑分片（如 tenant_id），可以分批迁移：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Week 1: 迁移 2025 年之前的历史分区（只读分区，风险低）&#10;Week 2: 迁移 2025 年的分区&#10;Week 3: 迁移 2026 年活跃分区（需要在线工具）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Week 1: 迁移 2025 年之前的历史分区（只读分区，风险低）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Week 2: 迁移 2025 年的分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Week 3: 迁移 2026 年活跃分区（需要在线工具）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略二：中间状态持久化</strong></p>\n<p>gh-ost 支持 <code>--postpone-cut-over-flag-file</code>，允许 copy 完成后暂停在「追赶 binlog」状态。利用这个特性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工作日白天暂停 copy（通过 throttle flag）</li>\n<li>夜间和周末全速运行</li>\n<li>跨越数天完成 copy，最终在低峰时段 cut-over</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>策略三：预拷贝 + 最终同步</strong></p>\n<p>对于跨数据中心的迁移：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>先用 <code>mysqldump --single-transaction</code> 导出全量到目标</li>\n<li>在目标库恢复并建立 binlog 复制</li>\n<li>等追平后执行流量切换</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"监控与可观测性\">监控与可观测性</h2><p>大表迁移需要持续数天的监控面板：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- MySQL: 实时观察 gh-ost 进度&#10;-- gh-ost 在 _orders_ghc 表中记录进度&#10;SELECT * FROM _orders_ghc ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 1;&#10;-- 输出：copy: 450000000/1200000000 (37.5%), lag: 0.8s, ETA: 18h&#10;&#10;-- 磁盘使用监控&#10;SELECT ROUND(SUM(data_length + index_length) / 1024/1024/1024, 2) AS total_gb&#10;FROM information_schema.tables&#10;WHERE table_name IN (&#39;orders&#39;, &#39;_orders_gho&#39;, &#39;_orders_ghc&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL: 实时观察 gh-ost 进度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- gh-ost 在 _orders_ghc 表中记录进度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _orders_ghc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 输出：copy: 450000000/1200000000 (37.5%), lag: 0.8s, ETA: 18h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 磁盘使用监控</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data_length </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index_length) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_gb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> information_schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tables</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> table_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'_orders_gho'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'_orders_ghc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键告警规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>磁盘使用率 &gt; 80%</strong> → 紧急暂停迁移</li>\n<li><strong>Replica lag &gt; 10s 持续 5 分钟</strong> → 暂停并通知</li>\n<li><strong>Copy 进度 24 小时无推进</strong> → 检查是否卡在某处</li>\n<li><strong>应用错误率上升 &gt; 基线 2x</strong> → 可能兼容性问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>大表迁移是运维项目而非单条命令——需要规划、预留、监控、调速的全流程管理</li>\n<li>四维制约（时间/空间/带宽/风险）互相博弈，需要在迁移前做量化评估</li>\n<li>chunk 自适应 + nice-ratio + max-lag 三者配合控制迁移对线上影响</li>\n<li>cut-over 是唯一短暂阻塞的时刻——选择低峰、确认无长事务、预设超时</li>\n<li>超大表（&gt;1TB）需要分阶段策略：分片分批、跨天执行、中间状态持久化</li>\n<li>持续监控是大表迁移的生命线——进度、磁盘、lag、错误率四指标缺一不可</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../tooling/gh-ost-and-pt-osc\">gh-ost 与 pt-online-schema-change</a>：工具的详细用法与架构差异</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../distributed-systems/fundamental-challenges/unreliable-network\">分布式系统中的网络不可靠性</a>：跨数据中心迁移时的网络可靠性考量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大表迁移实战","id":"大表迁移实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"执行前规划清单","id":"执行前规划清单"},{"level":2,"text":"Chunk 策略与自适应调速","id":"chunk-策略与自适应调速"},{"level":2,"text":"Replica Lag 管理","id":"replica-lag-管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Cut-over 时机与执行","id":"cut-over-时机与执行"},{"level":2,"text":"超大表的分阶段策略","id":"超大表的分阶段策略"},{"level":2,"text":"监控与可观测性","id":"监控与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"回滚策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/database-migration-patterns/operations/rollback-strategies"},"next":null}